⬤ Data tyes
1.string  单值( Caching & counters)
2.list    有序可重复链表(Queues & recent activity)
3.set     无序不重复( Unique values)
4.zset(Sorted Set)    带分数有序不重复
5.hash    一个 key，多个 field（最容易出大 key）
6.stream  
7.Bitmaps
8.HyperLogLog
9.Geo Spatial Indexes (底层：就是一个ZSet（有序集合）)

⬤ string
stores text,numbers or binary data
use: caching,counters,tokers
● example
set user:1:name "xiao"
get user:1:name

⬤ list
ordered collection of strings
use:Queues,Recent activilty,message queues
● example
LPUSH notifications "Nes msg"
Rpop  notifications

⬤ Set
unordered collection of unique strings
use: Tags,unique users,Remove duplicates
● example
SADD skills "Python" "Redis" "SQL"
SMEMBERS skills

⬤ Sorted Set(Zset)
collection of unique strings with a score(float)
use:leaderboards,Rankings,Top N items
● example
ZADD leaderboard 1500 "user1"
ZADD leaderboard 1200 "user2"
ZREVRANGE leaderboard 0 9 WITHSCORES

⬤ Hash
Field-value pairs
use: user profiles,Objects,Configuration
● example
HSET user:1 name "Sravan" role "Developer"
HGET user:1 name

⬤ Stream
Append-only sequence of entries
use:Event logs,messageing,Activilty feeds
● example
XADD events 1 type "login" user "sravan"
XREAD Count 10 STREAMS events 0

⬤ Bitmap
Stores bits(0 or 1)
use: Activity tracking,Sing-in streaks,Feature flags
● example
SETBIT signups 99 0
GETBIT signups 99

⬤ HyperLogLog
Probabilistic data structure for approximate unique count
use: Counting unique visitors,Page views
● example
PFADD visitors "user1" "user2"
PFCOUNT visitors

⬤ Geospatial
Stores geo coordinates(latitude,longitude)
use: Nearby places,Location search,Distance calculation
● example
GEOADD locations 120.15507 30.27408 "hangzhou"
GEORADIUS locations 120.15 30.27 100 km WITHDIST COUNT 10 ASC

